---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services" description="Astrology, Mediumship & Tarot services by Ledonie — The Little Witch.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Astrology · Medium · Tarot</p>
  </section>

  <section class="services">

    <div class="service-section" id="astrology">
      <div class="service-content">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon">☽</div>
          <h2>Astrology</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Astrology is the language of the cosmos — a map written in the stars at the moment of your birth that speaks to your 
          strengths, challenges, purpose, and timing. Whether you're seeking insight into your relationships, career, 
          spiritual path, or the season you're in — your birth chart holds the answers.
        </p>
        <div class="offerings">
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Birth / Natal Chart Reading</h3>
            <p>A deep-dive into your complete cosmic blueprint. We'll explore your Sun, Moon, rising sign, planetary placements, 
            aspects, and more. This is the foundational reading — 90 minutes.</p>
            <span class="price">$120 / 90 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Transit Report</h3>
            <p>What are the planets doing right now, and how are they affecting you specifically? A transit report looks at 
            current planetary movements and their meaning for your chart.</p>
            <span class="price">$80 / 60 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Solar Return</h3>
            <p>Your birthday marks when the Sun returns to its exact position at your birth. A solar return reading gives 
            you the themes and opportunities for the year ahead.</p>
            <span class="price">$90 / 60 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Monthly Horoscope</h3>
            <p>A written horoscope for your zodiac sign — published monthly. Covers key themes, dates to watch, and 
            cosmic guidance for the month ahead.</p>
            <span class="price">Free on the blog</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-image">☽</div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-section" id="medium">
      <div class="service-content">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon">👁</div>
          <h2>Mediumship</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          As a medium, I serve as a bridge between this world and the next. If you've lost someone you love and long 
          to know they're at peace — or that they have a message for you — I can help open that connection. 
          My approach is gentle, compassionate, and focused on love, not drama.
        </p>
        <p>
          I don't do cold readings or make general statements. What comes through is specific, personal, and meant for you.
        </p>
        <div class="offerings">
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Private Mediumship Reading</h3>
            <p>One-on-one session to connect with your loved one. Evidence of survival, messages of love, and 
            any guidance they have for you. 60 minutes.</p>
            <span class="price">$130 / 60 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Mediumship Gallery / Group Session</h3>
            <p>Open events where multiple people receive readings in a group setting. Each person receives a personal 
            reading in a supportive, shared environment.</p>
            <span class="price">$60 / person</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-image">👁</div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-section" id="tarot">
      <div class="service-content">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon">🃏</div>
          <h2>Tarot</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          The tarot is one of humanity's oldest wisdom tools — 78 cards that hold a mirror up to your inner world 
          and illuminate the path forward. Whether you're facing a decision, feeling stuck, or simply seeking direction, 
          the cards offer clarity and guidance.
        </p>
        <div class="offerings">
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Single Card Draw</h3>
            <p>A quick, focused reading around one specific question or situation. Great for daily guidance or 
            when you need a quick yes/no direction.</p>
            <span class="price">$30 / 15 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Three Card Reading</h3>
            <p>Past, present, future — or situation, obstacle, guidance. A simple but powerful three-card spread 
            for clarity on any topic.</p>
            <span class="price">$50 / 30 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="offering">
            <h3>Full Celtic Cross Reading</h3>
            <p>The classic 10-card spread. A deep, thorough reading exploring the full landscape of your question 
            or situation. The full picture.</p>
            <span class="price">$100 / 60 min</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-image">🃏</div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="booking-cta">
    <h2>Ready to Book?</h2>
    <p>I'd love to hear from you. Reach out and let's find a time that works.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.page-header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a3562, #2d1f47);
  color: white; text-align: center; padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
}
.page-header h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
.page-header .subtitle { color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }

.services { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; }

.service-section {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 200px; gap: 3rem;
  align-items: center; padding: 4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
}
.service-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.service-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.service-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; }
.service-header h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--deep-purple); }
.service-content p { margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
.service-image { font-size: 6rem; text-align: center; opacity: 0.15; }

.offerings { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
.offering { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
.offering h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--deep-purple); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.offering p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.offering .price { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; }

.booking-cta { text-align: center; background: var(--deep-purple); color: white; padding: 4rem 2rem; }
.booking-cta h2 { color: var(--gold); font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.booking-cta p { margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.8; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .service-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .service-image { display: none; }
}
</style>